; Reproducer for the unsigned result of `iabs` on its negation path (see
; README.md in this directory, issue 9): iabs(INT_MIN) must wrap to INT_MIN
; (0x80000000 with a signed tag), so the arithmetic shift yields
; 0xC0000000 (-1073741824). Observed: 0x40000000, i.e. the shift was
; logical because the value came out of the negation tagged u32.
function %iabs_min(i32 uext, i32 uext) -> i32 uext system_v {
block0(v0: i32, v1: i32):
    v2 = iabs v0
    v3 = iconst.i32 1
    v4 = sshr v2, v3
    return v4
}
